<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Window
    x:Class="IPDocketing.WinUI.MainWindow"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    Title="IP Docketing | By Anant Goel">

    <Grid x:Name="RootGrid" Background="Transparent">


        <!-- TONED DOWN.
             The first pass had these at 0.9 with peak alphas around 0x6B, which
             was fine while the surfaces above them were nearly opaque and wrong
             the moment they were not. With the panels genuinely translucent the
             field stopped being something glass refracts and became the thing
             you actually look at - big saturated blobs of blue, violet and teal
             sitting in the middle of the content area.

             THIRD PASS. Still far too loud: with the surfaces this translucent
             the field was not something the glass refracted, it was the thing
             you looked at. Cut again to roughly a third of the last values -
             canvas 0.20 with peaks around 0x14, so the strongest point of the
             strongest orb lands near 1.6% alpha. It should now read as a faint
             warmth in the background rather than as colour in its own right.

             The field's job is to give the material something to vary over, and
             it does that at a fraction of this strength. Peak alpha is now around
             0x24 with the canvas at 0.42, the orbs are larger and pushed toward
             the window corners so their centres sit outside the reading area, and
             the teal is pulled most of the way back to slate - it was the loudest
             of the three and the furthest from the app's navy. -->
        <!--
            STATIC, BUT NOT FAINT. Two different problems, two different fixes.

            The FLICKER was caused by movement, not by colour. Every glass
            surface samples and blurs what is behind it, so animating the
            backdrop made the compositor re-blur the whole window every frame;
            a missed frame shows as a flash to the AcrylicBrush FallbackColor.
            Holding the field still fixes that completely.

            Cutting the colour as well was an overcorrection, and it is what made
            the app look matte. Glass only reads as glass when there is something
            behind it worth refracting - strip the colour and a perfectly
            translucent surface has nothing to show but flat grey. So the colour
            is back up near where it reads as depth, and it simply does not move.

            It used to drift and breathe on long cycles. That was the wrong call
            here: the window sits on a system acrylic backdrop, and every glass
            surface above it samples and blurs whatever is behind. Animating the
            thing being sampled means the compositor re-blurs the whole window on
            every frame, forever. On ARM64 that is enough to miss frames, and a
            missed frame on an AcrylicBrush shows as a flash to its FallbackColor
            - which is the flicker on page switches and the restlessness at
            startup.

            Held still, these cost one composition and then nothing. The
            variation they give the material was the point; the movement was
            decoration that made the app worse.

            If motion is wanted back it belongs behind a setting AND behind a
            UISettings.AnimationsEnabled check, so Windows' Reduce Motion turns
            it off.
        -->
        <Canvas IsHitTestVisible="False" Opacity="0.55">
            <Ellipse x:Name="OrbAzure" Width="1180" Height="1180"
                     Canvas.Left="-520" Canvas.Top="-620">
                <Ellipse.Fill>
                    <RadialGradientBrush>
                        <GradientStop Color="#405B8CFF" Offset="0" />
                        <GradientStop Color="#1C5B8CFF" Offset="0.5" />
                        <GradientStop Color="#005B8CFF" Offset="1" />
                    </RadialGradientBrush>
                </Ellipse.Fill>
            </Ellipse>

            <Ellipse x:Name="OrbViolet" Width="1320" Height="1320"
                     Canvas.Left="1080" Canvas.Top="420">
                <Ellipse.Fill>
                    <RadialGradientBrush>
                        <GradientStop Color="#388A7DFF" Offset="0" />
                        <GradientStop Color="#188A7DFF" Offset="0.52" />
                        <GradientStop Color="#008A7DFF" Offset="1" />
                    </RadialGradientBrush>
                </Ellipse.Fill>
            </Ellipse>

            <!-- A third, cooler pole. Two orbs of similar hue average out to one
                 wash; a third at a distance is what keeps the field from looking
                 like a single gradient.

                 It was a saturated teal (#35D0B8), which is nowhere in this app's
                 palette and read as a green blob parked under the content. It is
                 now a desaturated steel that is barely a hue at all - it still
                 breaks up the other two, which is its whole job, without
                 announcing itself. -->
            <Ellipse x:Name="OrbTeal" Width="1020" Height="1020"
                     Canvas.Left="220" Canvas.Top="760">
                <Ellipse.Fill>
                    <RadialGradientBrush>
                        <GradientStop Color="#2A6E9BC4" Offset="0" />
                        <GradientStop Color="#126E9BC4" Offset="0.55" />
                        <GradientStop Color="#006E9BC4" Offset="1" />
                    </RadialGradientBrush>
                </Ellipse.Fill>
            </Ellipse>
        </Canvas>

        <!-- The band of light along the top edge of the window, where a real
             sheet of glass catches the sky. Cheap, static, and does more for the
             "pane of glass" read than any amount of extra blur. -->
        <Rectangle Height="180" VerticalAlignment="Top" IsHitTestVisible="False"
                   Fill="{StaticResource VibrantSheenBrush}" Opacity="0.30" />

        <Grid>
            <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                <RowDefinition Height="48" />
                <RowDefinition Height="*" />
            </Grid.RowDefinitions>

            <Grid x:Name="AppTitleBar" Padding="18,0,160,0" Background="Transparent">
                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="11" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                    <!-- Same artwork as the executable and the taskbar, so the
                         window identifies itself with one mark rather than two.
                         26px from a 256px source, which downsamples cleanly. -->
                    <Image Source="ms-appx:///Assets/app-icon.png"
                           Width="26" Height="26" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    <TextBlock Text="IP Docketing | By Anant Goel" FontFamily="Segoe UI Variable Display"
                               FontWeight="SemiBold" FontSize="13"
                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextPrimaryBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                    <Border Style="{StaticResource PillBadgeStyle}" Padding="8,3">
                        <TextBlock Text="LOCAL" FontSize="9" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                   Foreground="{ThemeResource TextTertiaryBrush}" CharacterSpacing="90" />
                    </Border>
                </StackPanel>
            </Grid>

            <NavigationView
                x:Name="NavView"
                Grid.Row="1"
                Background="Transparent"
                PaneDisplayMode="Left"
                IsBackButtonVisible="Collapsed"
                IsSettingsVisible="True"
                IsPaneToggleButtonVisible="True"
                IsPaneOpen="True"
                OpenPaneLength="252"
                CompactPaneLength="52"
                SelectionFollowsFocus="Disabled"
                SelectionChanged="NavView_SelectionChanged"
                Loaded="NavView_Loaded">

                <NavigationView.PaneHeader>
                    <TextBlock Text="WORKSPACE" Margin="8,10,0,12" FontSize="10"
                               CharacterSpacing="110" Foreground="{ThemeResource TextTertiaryBrush}" />
                </NavigationView.PaneHeader>

                <NavigationView.MenuItems>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Dashboard" Tag="Dashboard" IsSelected="True">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE80F;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Matters" Tag="Matters">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE7C3;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Deadlines" Tag="Deadlines">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE787;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Oppositions" Tag="Oppositions">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE7BA;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Automation" Tag="Automation">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE9F5;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Renewals" Tag="Renewals">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE823;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Status Tracker" Tag="StatusTracker">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE9D5;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="TM Search" Tag="TrademarkSearch">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE721;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Journal Watch" Tag="Journal">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE8A5;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Client Updates" Tag="ClientUpdates">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE715;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Activity Log" Tag="ActivityLog">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE81C;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="IP India Portal" Tag="IpIndiaPortal">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE774;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Calendar" Tag="Calendar">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE163;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="PTO Sync" Tag="PtoSync">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE895;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Documents" Tag="Documents">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE8A5;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                    <NavigationViewItem Content="Reports" Tag="Reports">
                        <NavigationViewItem.Icon><FontIcon Glyph="&#xE9D9;" /></NavigationViewItem.Icon>
                    </NavigationViewItem>
                </NavigationView.MenuItems>

                <NavigationView.PaneFooter>
                    <Border Margin="8,12,8,14" Padding="11,9" CornerRadius="14"
                            Background="{ThemeResource GlassInputBrush}"
                            BorderBrush="{StaticResource VibrantRimBrush}" BorderThickness="1.25">
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                            <Ellipse Width="7" Height="7" Fill="{StaticResource SuccessBrush}" VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                            <TextBlock Text="Encrypted local workspace" FontSize="11"
                                       Foreground="{ThemeResource TextSecondaryBrush}" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </NavigationView.PaneFooter>

                <Grid Background="Transparent">
                    <Grid.RowDefinitions>
                        <RowDefinition Height="72" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="Auto" />
                        <RowDefinition Height="*" />
                    </Grid.RowDefinitions>

                    <Border Margin="12,8,16,8" Style="{StaticResource VibrantPanelStyle}" CornerRadius="18">
                        <Grid Padding="16,0" ColumnSpacing="16">
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*" />
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <AutoSuggestBox x:Name="SearchBox" Width="360" MaxWidth="520"
                                            HorizontalAlignment="Left" VerticalAlignment="Center"
                                            PlaceholderText="Search matters and deadlines"
                                            QuerySubmitted="SearchBox_QuerySubmitted"
                                            Background="{ThemeResource GlassInputBrush}"
                                            BorderBrush="{ThemeResource GlassHairlineBrush}">
                                <AutoSuggestBox.QueryIcon>
                                    <SymbolIcon Symbol="Find" />
                                </AutoSuggestBox.QueryIcon>
                            </AutoSuggestBox>
                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="1" Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="10" VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                <StackPanel VerticalAlignment="Center">
                                    <TextBlock x:Name="DateText" HorizontalAlignment="Right" FontSize="12"
                                               Foreground="{ThemeResource TextSecondaryBrush}" />
                                    <TextBlock Text="Database ready" HorizontalAlignment="Right" FontSize="10"
                                               Foreground="{StaticResource SuccessBrush}" />
                                </StackPanel>
                                <Button x:Name="NotificationButton"
                                        Style="{StaticResource GlassButtonStyle}"
                                        Padding="12,8"
                                        Click="NotificationButton_Click"
                                        ToolTipService.ToolTip="Open deadline reminders">
                                    <Grid ColumnSpacing="7">
                                        <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                            <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto" />
                                        </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                        <FontIcon Glyph="&#xEA8F;" FontSize="15" />
                                        <Border x:Name="ReminderBadge"
                                                Grid.Column="1"
                                                MinWidth="20"
                                                Height="20"
                                                Padding="5,0"
                                                CornerRadius="7"
                                                Background="{StaticResource DangerBrush}">
                                            <TextBlock x:Name="ReminderCountText"
                                                       Text="0"
                                                       FontSize="10"
                                                       FontWeight="Bold"
                                                       Foreground="White"
                                                       HorizontalAlignment="Center"
                                                       VerticalAlignment="Center" />
                                        </Border>
                                    </Grid>
                                </Button>
                                <Button Content="Quick docket" Style="{StaticResource LiquidButtonStyle}"
                                        Click="QuickDocket_Click" />
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>
                    </Border>

                    <InfoBar x:Name="ReminderInfoBar"
                             Grid.Row="1"
                             Margin="12,0,16,8"
                             IsOpen="False"
                             IsClosable="True"
                             Severity="Warning"
                             Title="Deadline reminder">
                        <InfoBar.ActionButton>
                            <Button Content="View calendar"
                                    Style="{StaticResource GlassButtonStyle}"
                                    Click="ReminderView_Click" />
                        </InfoBar.ActionButton>
                    </InfoBar>

                    <Frame x:Name="ContentFrame" Grid.Row="2" Background="Transparent">
                        <!-- Pages slide and fade in rather than snapping. On a
                             translucent shell a hard cut is jarring: the whole
                             window is one continuous surface, so content should
                             arrive onto it rather than replace it. -->
                    </Frame>
                </Grid>
            </NavigationView>
        </Grid>
    </Grid>
</Window>
